[{"title":"送勤上人归灵鹫山","author":"张绅","text":"灵鹫禅房我所思，可堪春晚送勤师。\n乱山啼鸟烟霞里，一路落花风雨时。\n定有猿看窗外果，应知苔护壁间诗。\n门前有径通三竺，欲向中天采石芝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14895,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题江岫图","author":"张绅","text":"乌衣巷里东风老，蝴蝶飞来满芳草。\n美人春梦隔天涯，十二巫山眉不扫。\n巫山巫峡江水新，烟波渺渺江南春。\n鸳鸯不识横塘路，鹦鹉窗间呼向人。\n青绫谁共官曹宿，雪楮云毫吮晴绿。\n太常春瓮碧霞沉，六曲屏风对银烛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14896,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游冶城山","author":"张绅","text":"瑶草秋深石磴长，半空岚气湿衣裳。\n江山佳处一亭古，风雨来时四座凉。\n阴洞水腥龙蜕骨，仙岩云暖麝生香。\n道人好护新松树，长见清阴覆御床。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14897,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人赴安庆幕僚","author":"张绅","text":"舒州城在大江边，我昔过之曾系船。\n年丰米谷上街贱，日落鱼虾入市鲜。\n山起正当官署北，潮来直到驿楼前。\n知君此去红莲幕，民讼无多但昼眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14898,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高陵篇（并序）","author":"张绅","text":"道旁鬼镞飞神丛，狂客贼我人中龙。\n有儿十七心胆雄，意气奄有江之东。\n脐然未熄炎精委，四海英雄为时起。\n十年血战不成功，破面安能作天子。\n盘盘门外野水滨，可怜高冢埋麒麟。\n髑髅饮恨尚不朽，死骨肯作曹瞒臣。\n墓旁春草年年碧，黄金握臂人耕出。\n姓名幸尔人不知，却怪中平一方石。\n君不见吴王帐下越王舞，汉王成功楚王虏。\n英雄千载欲何为，尽作北邙山下土。\n又不见秦王治葬骊山宫，玉凫金雁俱成空。\n武皇求仙东海上，茂陵石马嘶秋风。\n与君下马高陵路，落日高城忽如堵。\n阖闾坏冢在城边，何须重叹孙王墓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14899,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送赵将军","author":"练高","text":"崆峒一剑倚秋阴，谁识将军百战心。\n老去功名余白发，闲来歌舞散黄金。\n呼鹰大泽风竿劲，射虎南山雪羽深。\n敲缺唾壶银烛短，时人不解垄头吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14900,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张起潜之柳州","author":"练高","text":"浔水环城拥翠来，柳阴府署倚云开。\n唐祠侑食歌丹荔，汉柱铭功篆绿苔。\n日落雷塘龙雾合，虹消桂岭飓风回。\n南行无雁音书少，别思绵绵不易裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14901,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送云南教授刘后耕","author":"练高","text":"见说思陵过五溪，热云蒸草瘴天低。\n星联南极穷朱鸟，山抱中流界碧鸡。\n苜蓿照盘官况冷，芭蕉夹道驿程迷。\n巍巍尧德元无外，未必文风阻远黎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14902,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张国录孟兼","author":"吴植","text":"昔别意何长，重来岁华改。\n沉忧谁与娱，怀人邈江海。\n褰衣涉汀洲，秋风被兰茝。\n日夕零露繁，芳馨为谁采。\n嘉会谅难并，良辰讵容待。\n思君如明月，夜夜望光彩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14903,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留别张孟兼","author":"吴植","text":"故人昔隐仙华山，高卧白云终日闲。\n我携清都绿玉杖，相与啸傲烟霞间。\n一朝忽被征书起，姓名直入明光里。\n清时冠带圜桥门，济济横经临璧水。\n坐拥皋比三载余，石室仍紬太史书。\n平生直气横秋岳，秉笔一字诛奸谀。\n迩来峻擢仪曹上，千载皇风回揖让。\n要知制作鲁诸生，元是传经旧刘向。\n蹇予泉石是生涯，白头受荐来京华。\n相逢共醉金陵市，一官却种河阳花。\n人生离会良可惜，已觉形容非昨日。\n马头万点蜀山青，回首秦淮烟树夕。\n丈夫才气古所难，去去有冠冠莫弹。\n郫筒酒熟宁辞饮，饭颗诗成得细看。\n怜君最是知予者，慷慨高歌起中夜。\n葛令丹砂或可求，王乔飞鸟还堪借。\n他时一笑蓬莱巅，碧桃乱发东风前。\n还将玉管吹明月，叶以云间紫凤篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14904,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过南湖戏折藕花","author":"吴植","text":"秋日南湖戏采莲，鸳鸯飞上木兰船。\n一声《白苎》知何处，无复闲情似少年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14905,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜和黄典签","author":"涂颖","text":"遥夜天宇迥，开轩坐前楹。\n月华临水动，凉风满庭生。\n屡惜玄景至，悟兹尘虑清。\n疏星明玉阙，委露金茎。\n流序倏将迈，嘉朋纷远征。\n微才旅群彦，鸣佩集玉京。\n文词资丽泽，笙磬感同声。\n非比江湖客，驰心摇悬旌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14906,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬邹伯谦见寄","author":"涂颖","text":"白发萧疏忝侍仪，夔龙青琐许追随。\n禁庐晚退仍分直，宣室春来屡祝釐。\n翔凤远连双玉阙，流莺深啭万年枝。\n老怀寥落将何补，空有云泉入梦思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14907,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题山水图","author":"涂颖","text":"忆昔滦阳八月归，北风吹雪洒秋衣。\n枪竿岭上停车望，万木潇潇落叶飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14908,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上京次贡待制韵三首 其一","author":"涂颖","text":"海风吹雨度龙沙，满眼金莲紫菊花。\n日暮笙歌何处起，高低穹帐五侯家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14909,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上京次贡待制韵三首 其二","author":"涂颖","text":"蓬莱仙子学长生，群帝朝天绛节迎。\n昨日六龙回北极，云裾霞佩集滦京。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14910,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上京次贡待制韵三首 其三","author":"涂颖","text":"竹宫窅窅秋风晚，芸阁沉沉昼漏稀。\n独有蕃僧承诏宠，红衣白马退朝归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14911,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡口晚泊四首 其一","author":"吴肜","text":"川路渺无际，扬帆溯流波。\n征人叹迟暮，舟子方笑歌。\n去去日将夕，维舟松上萝。\n坐啸微雨歇，洲渚落花多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14912,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡口晚泊四首 其二","author":"吴肜","text":"翠壁隐残照，沧洲生夕阴。\n鸥鸟忽飞去，幽幽春水深。\n涉险念先训，观风推圣心。\n功名觉迟暮，萧飒二毛侵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14913,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡口晚泊四首 其三","author":"吴肜","text":"日落潭水绿，松间闻子规。\n征途一万里，江月每相随。\n王事有程度，人心多险巇。\n周询庶有济，驱涉不知疲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14914,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡口晚泊四首 其四","author":"吴肜","text":"江烟敛初夕，华月入我舟。\n坐久风露集，微寒侵敝裘。\n戍鼓动边思，棹歌萦客愁。\n渐闻湍响急，度峡是归州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14915,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桐孙曲","author":"戈镐","text":"昆山玉轸苍梧云，胶弦漆水生古春。\n垂杨飞丝小莺舞，海上桃花响红雨。\n仙人鸾尾扫寒空，环佩行烟度湘浦。\n惊猿坠石秋云裂，铁网珊瑚碎明月。\n临邛病客看文君，鬓影星星半成雪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14916,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渌水词","author":"戈镐","text":"红船压秋绿，水涩藕根香。\n昨夜龙沙月，鸳鸯梦薄霜。\n秋弯扫蛾翠，生色染丝黄。\n为报浔阳客，行云不下堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14917,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈伯渊教授归沔阳 其一","author":"戈镐","text":"广文金闺身，台城一相见。\n壁素悬青灯，花虫蠹书卷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14918,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈伯渊教授归沔阳 其二","author":"戈镐","text":"去买沔阳船，挂帆上秋水。\n别路折垂杨，歌声断肠起。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14919,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈伯渊教授归沔阳 其三","author":"戈镐","text":"花落烟江口，青苎新槽酒。\n索寞辞官资，还家奉眉寿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14920,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春晓词","author":"戈镐","text":"鸦啼细柳东方明，井上辘轳牵水声。\n花奴满堂开翠屏，银炉烧麝素烟轻。\n西原落落秦川路，白马花鞭几时去。\n落花昨夜飞成团，蝴蝶归来及春暮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14921,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄刘彦炳","author":"戈镐","text":"征旆遥分苑路西，马蹄春去弋阳溪。\n相思欲和乌啼曲，一拂瑶弦意总迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14922,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题野塘秋景","author":"戈镐","text":"芙蓉秋色满银塘，白鹭双飞下晚凉。\n记得采莲看越女，醉骑骄马映垂杨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14923,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"来鹤诗赠周玄初","author":"戈镐","text":"香案灵文一篆通，翩翩云鹤下天风。\n初辞蓬岛离珠树，又掠银河过蕊宫。\n六翮舞随清磬响，九皋鸣断碧云空。\n欲归南岳夫人召，回首仙台夜月中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14924,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送郑仲宗还金华","author":"吕复","text":"都门盛冠盖，乃与行者别。\n行者来复还，使我心哽咽。\n人留棹声迟，酒既骊歌彻。\n绿柳阴正圆，相看不忍别。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14925,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题方壶苍山秋意图","author":"吕复","text":"昔游华盖仙人掌，万叠芙蓉紫翠生。\n犹记月明闻铁笛，人间无处著秋声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14926,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湛上人钟秀楼诗楼在四明东湖上","author":"陶谊","text":"百尺楼居耸碧霄，天开图画足逍遥。\n一帆春雨来湖口，两岸青山落树腰。\n夜坐翻经香欲冷，诗成倚柱酒微消。\n东还拟遂登临兴，惭愧无才趁早朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14927,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人从役","author":"陶谊","text":"沅湘南去远，古戍楚云边。\n山雨虫蛇出，江天螮蝀悬。\n相思知后夜，重会更何年。\n喜得风涛静，官船任昼眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14928,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘子高赠王明善依韵以和","author":"萧执","text":"匡庐之山瀑布泉，老子结社来何年。\n林间经罢常随鹿，云外樵归或遇仙。\n坐石有时巾挂树，焚香终日袖携烟。\n市南别有秋江水，种得花开总是莲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14929,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绿筠轩为姚宰作","author":"萧执","text":"绿筠阴阴翳窗户，此是姚侯读书处。\n摇空翡翠晚宜人，食实鸾凰晓相语。\n稚子牵衣惜春露，候卒编篱护秋雨。\n何当便弃人间事，抱琴走觅湖山住。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14930,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次答刘汝弼见寄之什时汝弼客德庆侯第","author":"萧执","text":"春事今余几，花枝已不多。\n向人愁作客，思尔积成疴。\n威凤翔高汉，慈乌恋旧窠。\n平津东阁好，早晚定相过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14931,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南湖斋居寄友人","author":"王敬中","text":"山寒夜透青绫被，海日朝明白玉珂。\n隐几不知春色晚，停杯惊见落花多。\n旃檀香里来僧梵，杨柳桥边起棹歌。\n咫尺湖光不相见，竹床琴调近如何？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14932,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠周玄初尊师","author":"王敬中","text":"玄都道士身如鹤，长傍青松寄此生。\n梦破九霄风雨急，神游八表雪霜清。\n琼笙每应秋声起，缟羽微连夜色明。\n我欲相从拾瑶草，漫山落叶断人行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14933,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日雨中示友人","author":"吴去疾","text":"二月已过三月临，茅堂寂寥常雨阴。\n梅花白白落已尽，杨柳青青浑未深。\n何日新晴出山郭，及时行乐称春心。\n应须载酒穷幽赏，烂醉扶肩过竹林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14934,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬李卿","author":"吴去疾","text":"李卿好客天下无，日日相过惟酒徒。\n眼花耳热不复醉，瓶罄樽空还复酤。\n去年解后留君第，七日疏狂淹客途。\n近有新词来寄我，洒然清兴满江湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14935,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读子书作","author":"周子谅","text":"学馆坐无事，故书聊复看。\n披文既荟蕞，寻义亦泮涣。\n趋前后已逸，顾旧新辄窜。\n万言虽毕陈，一理竟未贯。\n往往未终卷，心目已溃乱。\n置书敛视听，境地甚澄晏。\n《易》、《书》、《诗》、《春秋》，辞简义亦焕。\n緌书言五千，隐约可徐玩。\n奈何百家言，磊磊叠几案。\n绵延比葛藟，根远益缠绊。\n遂令矜名士，摹放如习幻。\n雕刳出葩卉，缀缉呈组纂。\n悦目效女美，饫口匪刍豢。\n推以合身心，宜若霄壤判。\n吾欲尽其文，掇取归炉炭。\n观心胜观书，矹矹坐夜旦。\n濯秽来清澄，磨昏出璀璨。\n绵绵春云舒，炯炯秋月烂。\n咏歌成文章，昭倬比云汉。\n往者予弗及，来者予何惮。\n作诗示朋曹，无乃骇童丱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14936,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别郭元达","author":"周子谅","text":"黄鹄乘天风，飘飘忽高翔。\n飞飞巢林鸟，刷羽情内伤。\n岂无凌霄志，六翮不得长。\n念子平生意，相送以徬徨。\n勿言易为别，明发各一方。\n悲来解佩剑，为子复进觞。\n且为游子歌，歌词何慨慷。\n疾风吹征帆，旭日在衣裳。\n自古有离别，各言慎行藏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14937,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白苎词","author":"周子谅","text":"井梧坠叶声如雨，辘轳夜静莎鸡语。\n西里佳人怨薄寒，惆怅灯前歌白苎。\n白苎新时白若霜，象床开合秋水光。\n制成只恐香尘污，衣着偏宜九夏凉。\n西风乍入罗帏里，数点清尘不禁洗。\n竞开箧笥试新纨，旧服抛捐那复理。\n嗟尔白苎怨勿深，怜新弃旧他人心。\n愿将贞白永相保，今年卷却明年讨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14938,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"越城谣","author":"程国儒","text":"越州城，城何高，四十五里之周遭。\n洼地填为基，陂陀凿成壕。\n白昼鞭笞夜击櫜，石民之骨灰民膏，越城虽高越民劳。\n越民劳未已，我田未耕又科米。\n忙忙筑城归种禾，又恐无米供官科。\n禾苗未青得秋雨，城吏打门夜如虎。\n为言雨后新城摧，要我荷锸城上来。\n城泥不干不敢回，又恐夜半闻春雷。\n城头一雨城一动，越民登城向天恸。\n民心似与雨有仇，天意实谓城无用。\n当年当年天下平，天下无贼越无城，乃知在德不在兵。\n愿无修城愿修德，使民复睹无城日。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14939,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"信州粮谣","author":"程国儒","text":"信州粮，粮何艰，十钟一石万里间。\n朝发钱王堤，暮过严子滩，柁尾白浪如银山。\n朝渡兰溪州，暮泊龙丘湾，峻如牵车上鬼关。\n督吏持檄夜如箭，布帆无风河水干。\n去年粮船未及岸，今年又运八百万。\n只知彼地荒，不知浙东天亦旱。\n只知彼地饥，不知役户家无饭。\n家无饭，侬莫愁，愿化铁骑为耕牛。\n愿销锋镝为锄耰，战场辟作畎与沟。\n壮士负戈荷甲归西畴，风雨时调禾黍秋。\n禾黍不秋饭不足，浙东又移何郡粟？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14940,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次栾秉德韵","author":"程国儒","text":"伤心世事泪潺潺，已付余生作等闲。\n羝乳尚能持汉节，鸡鸣那得出秦关。\n黄花时候多新酒，绿树门庭是故山。\n日夜思亲头尽白，何人为赋大刀环。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14941,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓舍偶题","author":"甘瑾","text":"四海戎麾满，中原汗马疲。\n龙蛇伤纪岁，麟凤叹非时。\n土贡包茅废，边防羽檄驰。\n杜陵忧国念，蒦闷强裁诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14942,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题何梅阁山居","author":"甘瑾","text":"迹不到城市，逢人无厚颜。\n一瓢风外树，双屐雨中山。\n流水春喧碓，归云暮掩关。\n忧时心未已，祇益鬓毛斑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14943,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题高伯昌远游卷","author":"甘瑾","text":"九月朔方城，河流已冱凝。\n毡车驰犯雪，乳碗饮兼冰。\n汗血宛西马，奇毛代北鹰。\n良材资国用，翘首即飞腾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14944,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题张氏竹园别业","author":"甘瑾","text":"避难疏狂客，长贫少定居。\n采芝空有曲，种树岂无书。\n拟制东山屐，看驰下泽车。\n肯容疏懒迹，来与狎樵渔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14945,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送防秋将","author":"甘瑾","text":"玉帐秋风动，边尘飒飒惊。\n射雕轻汉将，牧马过秦城。\n白草交河道，清笳捕虏营。\n战装宜即换，已及早寒生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14946,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋闺怨","author":"甘瑾","text":"惆怅下帘钩，庭空月影流。\n锦衾成独旦，罗扇觉先秋。\n火熟薰笼暖，泉寒汲绠修。\n祇怜云际雁，传得玉关愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14947,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"公孙","author":"甘瑾","text":"跃马公孙氏，荆湖旧拓疆。\n函书邻好绝，陛戟霸图荒。\n城堞迷秋草，楼船散夕阳。\n龙文成五采，终古在芒砀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14948,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠人戍襄阳","author":"甘瑾","text":"汉水荒城外，频年汗马场。\n舟车通馈饷，部曲杂耕桑。\n幕府文书暇，烽楼警逻长。\n山公有爱将，日醉习池旁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14949,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅溪宿徐橘隐者寓舍别后寄谢","author":"甘瑾","text":"不见故人久，吟愁入鬓丝。\n试呼村舍酿，细论草堂诗。\n夜雨西窗烛，春风别墅棋。\n沧州如有约，岁晚共襟期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14950,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙虎冲虚张真人游仙诗二首 其一","author":"甘瑾","text":"世业神明裔，朝家礼秩优。\n祝釐宣室夜，赐曲鉴湖秋。\n海月虚瑶席，天风驷玉虬。\n谷神应不死，独与化为谋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14951,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙虎冲虚张真人游仙诗二首 其二","author":"甘瑾","text":"默观玄化运，乘彼白云归。\n广野悲张乐，青山笑拂衣。\n玉棺天上葬，神剑□间飞。\n圭组褒崇旧，宜看奕叶辉。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14952,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读靖康遗事","author":"甘瑾","text":"杜鹃啼老洛城东，烽火郊畿纵犬戎。\n庙略合收淝水捷，虏盟谁定渭桥功。\n铜驼故陌迷芳草，黄屋惊尘卷朔风。\n一自鼎湖龙去后，小臣何地泣遗弓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14953,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读史有感二首 其一","author":"甘瑾","text":"二龙怅望杳东游，弓剑苍茫满地愁。\n青草空遗双冢月，彩云已散六宫秋。\n长江落日忠臣恨，易水寒风壮士羞。\n楚汉兴亡俱一梦，当时何用割鸿沟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14954,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读史有感二首 其二","author":"甘瑾","text":"汴流西绕汉时宫，陵树萧萧易朔风。\n金碗不冰银雁去，铜仙无露玉盘空。\n御沟流水人间碧，禁苑蟠桃海上红。\n却忆晋家南渡客，清谈不记误和戎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14955,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]